      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so if you look at the actual people involved, like what do the \"new\" residents usually look like in terms of lifestyle or background vs the people who have lived there for a long time? like what's the profile of the people moving in and what's the profile of the people that usually end up leaving when the area starts to change?",
